  "prefLabel": "Psyc 103.02 Custodian of the Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Psyc 103.02 Custodian of the Records. The office of professional licensure and certification is the custodian of the board’s records at its offices, and shall respond to requests to examine any portion of the board’s records in accordance with the time limits set forth in RSA 91-A:4.\n\nSource. #12035-A, eff 11-4-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/psyc100-500.html"
